WEBVTT

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:14.570
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.800
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.140
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.250
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:29.180
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.720
You okay, Mahiro?

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:37.560
Yeah!

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.090
You okay too, Chii-chan, Saa-chan?

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:39.960
Yeah!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:40.890
Yes...

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:44.600
Tokiko is fighting alone. l have to go back.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:46.030
Right!

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.830
ls it true there are girls who got left behind?!

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:50.170
Y-yeah, if l remember right...!

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.900
You got a weapon?!

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:52.340
Yeah!

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:53.110
All right, let's go!

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:56.910
Abandoning girls is a disgrace to the buddy-buddy class 2-B!

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:59.280
Bring it, monster!

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.320
Hey...what...?

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:04.950
Th...thank goodness you're safe...

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:05.890
What happened to the monster?

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:08.250
The lance guy took it out!

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.390
The lance guy...saved us...

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:12.830
Really?

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.760
But...isn't he an enemy...?

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.800
<i>Signs of Death</i>

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:28.740
Can...you explain, Suzuki?

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:36.720
<i>By any chance, is it that you yourself,</i> <i>not the two outside...are the enemy?</i>

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.020
<i>lt seems this is as far as you go, Shinyo.</i>

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.430
<i>Master Butterfly!</i>

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:51.160
<i>Good job. You did well</i> <i>with a body lacking kakugane.</i>

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.130
<i>Then!</i>

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.700
l'm finished with you.
Become lunch with the other students.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:01.810
<i>Nooooo! lt's over!</i>

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.180
<i>Everyone will die! Everyone will get killed!</i>
<i>Everyone will be eaten!</i>

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.540
Shut up!

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:07.710
lt's not over yet!

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:11.420
That's right! There are those two people fighting the monsters!

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:12.990
We've been saying it since earlier!

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:14.220
Those two...

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.990
<i>...are everyone's...allies!</i>

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.660
Splatter your guts out!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:23.970
Energy!

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.300
Full! Blast!

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:30.230
So you've regained your strength, huh...?

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:33.110
At any rate, you guys are more trouble than l thought you'd be.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:37.670
The warriors are stronger than anticipated...? Or...

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.620
Tokiko!

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:41.980
You okay, Kazuki?!

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:45.420
l'm okay! l've got a little more power than earlier!

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.920
As l recall, you said something like that during the Papillon thing, too...

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:53.100
<i>lt's like you're really having someone</i> <i>share their power with you...</i>

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.330
Feed me!

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:03.300
Tokiko, this desk...

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:06.300
Yeah, it wasn't aimed toward us.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:10.810
<i>Hey! Don't be lowering your guard!</i>
<i>For that matter, don't be flirting out there!</i>

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.880
<i>Everyone's totally watching!</i>

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.830
Thanks back there! You were kind of cool!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:32.370
l'm sorry! l got the wrong idea! l'm really sorry!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.900
Do your best, Big Broth... l mean, person l don't know!

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.840
Nobody will make that mistake again!

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.810
<i>lf you guys are our allies...</i>

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:43.820
<i>then we're your allies, too!</i>

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:48.090
Guys...!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.690
lnsignificant humans!

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.560
Don't be pressing your luck being the food as you are!

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:56.180
Feed me!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.770
They're eating each other!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.630
No! They're not eating each other!

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.040
This is...!

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:17.910
Wha...!

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:20.280
They merged and got huge!

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:23.420
Kazuki!

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.220
Leave it to me, Tokiko!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:29.560
lt's okay! l kind of feel like l've got the most power ever welling up inside!

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:33.520
Homunculus super adult form! Go!

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.170
Energy full blast!

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.740
<i>He's strong...!</i>

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:51.880
<i>Too strong!</i>

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:54.620
<i>This strength is out of the ordinary.</i>

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:59.360
<i>lt's really like he's having someone</i> <i>share their power with him...</i>

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.160
<i>Wait, no. lt's not just that.</i>

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:03.460
One more to go!

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:10.530
You've gotten so strong Kazuki Muto. l can hardly recognize you.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:13.140
But l'm also strong as you see!

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:14.570
Chono!

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:20.170
There are two Moon Faces...
A doppelganger?

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.370
Or were you twins to begin with?

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:27.410
Doppelganger? Twins?
Come on. Look closer.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:30.310
The two of us aren't the same.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.750
l'm Nijyurokuya Moon Face!

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.450
l'm Sengetsu Moon Face!

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:38.160
And l'm Mayuzuki Moon Face!

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:42.030
Furthermore, l'm Hihaku Moon Face!

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:43.370
Kangetsu Moon Face!

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.070
Nijyusan-Yamachi Moon Face!

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:46.300
Gyokkou Moon Face!

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.170
Kagen Moon Face!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.210
Mangetsu Moon Face!

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:49.170
Ooh!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:50.500
Beautiful!

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:51.470
Shingetsu Moon Face!

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:52.230
Scary!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.140
There's the age of the moon from zero to twenty-nine.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:58.620
Along with that number, l multiply into thirty forms.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:03.750
That is the special property of this moon fang Buso Renkin, the Satellite Thirty.

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.690
Thirty against one!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.950
lt'll be a marathon match, but can you win?

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:11.020
l just have to beat each of them one by one!

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:13.130
—Moon!
—Moon!

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.070
Bravo Arts, One of 13!

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.070
Smash! Bravo Rush!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.700
Moon! Moon! Moon-moon!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:20.800
—Moon!
—Moon!

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:22.170
—Moon!
—Moon!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:26.980
That won't work!
The Silver Skin's defense is invincible!

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.610
Slash! Bravo Chop!

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:32.480
Bring it...on!

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:33.520
Moooooon!

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.330
Moon!

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:47.090
What're you celebrating for?

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.160
Moon?

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.960
You're the only one left.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.970
One? Nope...

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:57.430
All thirty of the multiples of me l made with the Satellite Thirty are real versions...

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:00.880
lf you leave even one remaining, l will once again...

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.180
As you can see!

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:05.750
No matter how powerful your attacks are,

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.980
you obviously lack the means to wipe out all thirty of us in the blink of an eye!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.550
With invincible defense against infinite multiplication,

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.790
this would seem to be a marathon match with no finish line...

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.160
But this is human versus homunculus!

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:21.720
There's no need to say which one's vitality will hold out longer!

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.170
The finish line is your death!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:28.130
You fell for Doctor Butterfly's scheme!

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.180
And it's about the time for Him to awaken.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:34.110
Once that happens, those kid warriors will be helpless.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.220
You don't know when to quit.

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:39.880
Come to think of it, remember?

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:42.180
The subordinate of yours who l first took care of

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.420
didn't know when to quit and l had a rough time of it.

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:48.560
lt took two full days to finish him off.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:53.300
l see. So he didn't know when to give up, huh...?

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.090
Moon?

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:57.730
So he fought through to the end with a strong will, huh?!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:07:59.330
Bravo!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.530
The number fifty-two kakugane!

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:03.300
The item taken back from Kinjo!

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:06.340
Silver Skin!

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.380
Alternate Type!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.720
Don't think alchemist warriors are that simple!

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:16.280
Warrior Tokiko and Warrior Kazuki

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:19.850
shall fight to the end with a strong will no matter what the situation!

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.190
l will not let another one of my men die again!

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.470
Who's that?

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:33.100
l know! lt's that urban legend guy...

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.940
lt's the pervert who floats in the air!
The papillon mask phantom!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.440
ls he an enemy?! Or is he an ally?!

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:43.040
l don't remember summoning you.
What're you doing here?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.170
Well let me see...

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:50.710
You might say l am here to display this form that can now fly higher and further on its own.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.220
Those wings...Buso Renkin, huh?

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:57.190
Exactly. l call it
Near-Death Happiness!

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:59.490
l can change the shape at will...

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:02.230
l can move them at will...

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:05.340
And l can set fire at will.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.170
Black Powder Buso Renkin!

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:13.310
This is strong if l do say so myself.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:22.220
There's no need to protect me anymore.
Thanks for everything, my ancestor.

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.610
Let me thank you first...

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:27.360
And then, let's see.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:32.530
I'll completely burn down this school, which doesn't have even one good memory.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.830
And then lastly...

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:40.530
Fine, Chono. However, l'm changing the sequence of what you just said.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.200
First will be to settle things with LXE!

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:45.340
Then I'll fight you!

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:46.740
Very well.

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:52.350
Every single one of you... treats me like an opening act, huh?

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:56.620
lncluding the girl,
I'll take on all three of you.

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.820
I'll make you taste the power...

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:02.790
that Shishaku Chono, homunculus and founder of LXE,

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:05.300
has cultivated over the past hundred years!

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.710
My...my ears hurt...!

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:19.610
What's that sound?!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:26.290
The alarm... He...my friend...

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.010
...has awakened!

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:38.160
What's this...?!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.120
Angel Gozen!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.630
What? l kind of...

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:43.530
Suddenly...

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.070
Chii-chin! Saa-chan!

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:46.200
What?!

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:48.030
Wha...What...?!

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:52.680
lt's like...

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:55.110
Strength is draining...from my body...

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.470
This is his meal.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:02.480
He doesn't pay attention to something like flesh, which has poor absorption efficiency.

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:07.580
He directly takes away the life force and can make that into energy for himself!

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.520
This is bad, Kazuki!

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:14.530
lf we don't do something quickly... everyone will be eaten alive!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.400
l won't let that happen!

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:19.960
lmpudent boy!
That line belongs to...

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:24.340
...the improved Doctor Butterfly,
Master Butterfly!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:31.410
There's no need for you to go along with the sequence Muto determined.

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:36.150
lf you're going to go along with something either way, could you make it <i>my</i> sequence?

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:37.320
Chono!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.050
Don't concern yourself with them!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:40.650
lf they're going to fight among themselves, let them do as they like!

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.150
More importantly!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:42.920
That's right!

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:46.960
More importantly, first we've got to stop that flask as soon as possible!

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:48.360
Let's go, Tokiko!

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:54.070
You worthless greenhorn...

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:58.640
So this is how things stand, you forgetting the debt you owe me for saving your life?

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:02.670
You just used me for a guinea pig, right? l'd say things are square for both of us.

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:05.440
How do you explain the kakugane issue?

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:08.450
l took it under my own power.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:12.890
Even so, l'm grateful to you more or less, my ancestor...

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:16.180
The research you left was the catalyst.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.060
And most of all, this suit is totally the greatest.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:24.200
But l've no intention of behaving myself so far as to be told l'm being protected.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:28.070
Test with your life whether or not l need protection!

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:30.170
Rebellion is settled.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:31.070
ln other words...

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.540
your death is settled.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:36.740
Oops, the special property of your Buso Renkin is figured out already.

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:39.990
lt affects the nerve threads and throws off sense of direction.

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:42.920
You're no match for my Near-Death Happiness!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:47.050
You fool! That's just an effect in a diffused state.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:50.960
The effect won't end at that in a concentrated state!

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:55.100
Behold! The true power of my Buso Renkin!

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:56.330
This is...!

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:04.210
My mask! My mask is gone! lf l don't have it...! l...!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.980
There it is! ln a place like that!

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:09.320
Ohhh! Wait!

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.280
Hey! No running in the halls!

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:16.590
What, you're still in school?!
You're troublesome, so just quit already!

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:17.950
Mita?

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:22.060
Watch where you're going, you over-protected weakling!

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:23.380
Saruwatari!

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.800
<i>Socially Withdrawn</i>
This means you!

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.190
Kawazui!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:34.000
lt seems you're going to die of sickness?

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:35.170
Hanabusa!

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.070
Oh, then l'm finished with you.

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:40.780
So you were idling away your time in a place like this, huh?

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:43.210
Now, let's start training.

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:46.080
lf things go on like this, you'll be just a good-for-nothing.

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:49.620
lt's okay, Washio. l've already written this guy off.

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:51.750
l've decided Jiro will be the successor.

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:53.420
That's right!

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:55.930
Everything of the Chono family belongs to me!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:59.930
So give this to me, too!
So? How do l look?

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:08.700
This is the true special property... lf l concentrate it and raise the density

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:13.870
it affects the center of the nerve threads, the brain, and causes hallucinations.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:18.410
Chaff Buso Renkin, Alice in Wonderland.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:23.280
I'll grind you down and kill you from the inside of your mind.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:25.460
I'll burn your body up before that!

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:28.990
No way, no way!
That's totally impossible for you!

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.150
Because, see?!

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:32.220
As you see!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.960
You've already plunged into Wonderland

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:40.160
where you can't tell the difference between reality and illusion...

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:43.380
This voice may not even be reaching you now...

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:46.640
Even though we're the same Chono, we're of a different caliber.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:52.150
l encountered ultimate life and used alchemy as a means for evolution.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:58.350
But you just used alchemy as a means to escape from the fear of death.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:03.690
Both your mind and body are weak.
You're finished now, Koshaku.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.320
Don't call me by that name...!

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:10.760
That talk is from when we were both humans, right?

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:13.600
Things are different now.
Totally different.

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:15.870
My name is...

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.310
Papillon!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:26.640
Koshaku!

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.120
Don't call me by that name!

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.710
There's only one person who can call me by that name!

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.620
The only person who saw through the death of the man

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:37.130
you say was weak both in mind and body!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:43.270
Bring it, my ancestor! I'll blow away reality and illusion all at once!

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.730
Then I'll just attack you with a different illusion!

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.240
l guess this one should be enough.

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:51.630
Lose your way! Wonderland!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:59.840
Wonderland eats away at the person's brain with a powerful emission of light.

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:01.780
ln other words, there's no problem

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:04.480
if l block it with explosive flame the instant the light is emitted.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.620
Your cards have been revealed.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:10.750
l exploited my reputation as a genius before l got sick!

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:14.320
That's right! l'm a genius, so l've got my wits about me!

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.100
The next action has already been taken!

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:21.300
Maximum acceleration...
Go! Butterflies of Black Death!

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:26.640
What's the matter, genius?
What're you surprised for?

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.580
lf you're a genius, then l'm a super genius.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:35.620
The diffused Alice in Wonderland throws off your sense of direction.

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.360
You wouldn't hit me

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:41.150
if you were to aim in this fog from a distance of three feet away.

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:43.150
And one more thing.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:47.400
Not only is your sense of direction thrown off,

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:48.960
but your sense of distance as well.

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:49.690
Shoot...!

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:58.370
lt wasn't good...to have the situation disturbed by you and the lance boy

00:16:58.440 --> 00:17:00.340
and to get you guys worked up.

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:04.210
lf l handle things coolly and calmly, it's as you see...

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:09.520
l knew you couldn't fly high and far by yourself...

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:17.190
You've turned into a good-for-nothing.

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.230
Here you should've just let yourself be protected

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:22.530
without having unnecessary pride...

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:26.500
At the end of the day, the only thing you were able to accomplish

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:31.530
was to become the cornerstone of His resurrection! l'm finished with you! Perish!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:37.620
That...man in the flask...
What's his true identity?

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:39.810
ls he really a homunculus?

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:42.790
There's no way the man who is king of the homunculi

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:44.820
would be the same as the homunculi.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:50.360
He's a third existence, not human and not homunculus.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:54.260
He's the man standing at the apex of living organisms

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:57.770
who can eat even homunculi!

00:17:58.070 --> 00:17:59.800
After l saw him for the first time,

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:04.400
l automatically threw myself down on my knees within my heart

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:07.340
as a scholar, as an alchemist and as a human.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:12.520
I'll absolutely resurrect him no matter how long it takes.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:14.520
That's my destiny.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:18.790
l became a humanoid homunculus for that purpose...

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:25.060
Even you who do not know your place will understand that if you see his power.

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:28.390
But at this moment, that won't happen.

00:18:29.070 --> 00:18:30.700
l don't know about that.

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:33.270
Butterflies of Black Death,

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.740
360° all-round deployment disregarding distance.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:41.180
With this your Buso Renkin will be useless, right?

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:42.770
Are you crazy?!

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:45.450
Now you'll also get blown away!

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:49.620
This body already died once.
No problem, no problem.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:50.950
Wait! Stop!

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.180
Now you try confronting death!

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.550
lt's surprisingly fascinating, and addictive!

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:10.010
Still...the "Third Existence" that exceeds both humans and homunculi, eh?

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:16.040
l was convinced the humanoid homunculus was of the highest class...the ultimate,

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:19.640
but to think there were further heights above it...

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:23.710
lf you doubt it, verify it with your own eyes.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.380
And learn your place!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.920
So you learned your place in that way, huh?

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:33.490
And you were satisfied with the humanoid homunculus.

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:37.760
Although you knew of further heights, you didn't attempt to flap your wings!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:39.730
l've decided!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:45.640
I'll cast off this incomplete body and flap my wings towards further heights!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:50.010
My ancestor. We resemble each other, but we're different.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:53.070
You just sneak about drawn by a radiant light...

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:58.380
You're an unsightly moth that can't fly high or far by yourself!

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:01.760
Don't stop, Kazuki!

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.120
l know, Tokiko!

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:07.160
Now getting up to the roof one minute, one second faster is top priority!

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.530
l know!

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.030
<i>l know! But...!</i>

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:16.340
Kazuki!

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:18.580
This is...!

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:24.450
Guys...

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:25.880
Kazuki!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:27.850
Don't open it, Kazuki!

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:31.450
l know how you feel!
But we have to move forward now!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:33.020
Don't open it!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.560
<i>lf you open it, not only your legs,</i> <i>but your heart will stop as well!</i>

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.720
l'm sorry. l can't...

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.270
...just pass right by.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:42.230
Kazuki!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.820
Pale blue glowing hair,

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.190
bronze-colored skin,

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:50.800
the third entity that is neither human nor homunculi...

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:53.470
What have l done...to Kazuki?!

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:56.200
Next time, "Who Are You?"

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.300
I'll splatter your guts out!
